            },
            {
              "n": 4,
              "text": "<b>or</b> (using F = –Le)<br><b>M1</b> 8.51 ÷ 23.0 = 0.370 moles of electrons / atoms Na <b>and</b> 36 000 ÷ 0.370 <b>or 97 297</b> (value for F)",
